  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support is a JFA (Dfid, Irish Aid, Netherlands and UNAIDS) to the Health Economics and HIV/AIDS Research Division at the University of KwaZulNatal for the implementation of HEARDs business plan.The business plan addresses the following i) applied research on HIV ii) to build capacity among leaders from public/private sectors/CSOs iii) to promote multidisciplinary responses to the HIV epidemics</narrative>
  </description>
